# The top row's marks: a workspace being transcribed (its dot, recording), a workspace of one app
# pane (a test run has no app's icon: its fallback dot), a task that needs you (amber), a task whose
# agent works (its badge's border, breathing; held still in a test run), an empty workspace (a quiet
# dot); Home on show, the sidebar collapsed. Then four more tasks opened, till the items not
# selected are their marks alone (icon-only). Made-up lines and turns.
